# Task 144-027 Execution Plan
## Goal
Add DB-write coverage tests to tests/orchestra/sprint-reporter-ci.test.ts

## Approach
1. Import MemoryStore and appendCiHealthToRetro, runCiLearningAnalysis, appendCiLearningsToMemory from sprint-reporter.js
2. Create a new describe block for "appendCiHealthToRetro — DB-write coverage"
3. Use in-memory SQLite (:memory:) MemoryStore harness with beforeEach/afterEach
4. Write 6 new DB-write assertion tests:
   a. store.upsert is called for a valid CI report + store combo
   b. Entry "twice" assertion: ci-report + learning = 2 entries when called together (via runCiLearningAnalysis)
   c. DB content validate — entry title, type, content, tags match expected
   d. Idempotency — calling appendCiHealthToRetro twice → still only 1 entry (getById returns existing, skip)
   e. no-op without store — no crash when store is undefined
   f. appendCiLearningsToMemory upsert — validates ci-learnings-latest entry

